## 6. Database Changes

- **27 tables created** via Alembic migration `0001_initial_schema`
- All FKs, unique constraints, and indexes defined
- `created_at`/`updated_at` on every table
- Enum types matching the spec (roles, statuses)

---

## 7. API Endpoints (This Milestone)

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/` | Root info |
| GET | `/api/v1/health` | Liveness |
| GET | `/api/v1/health/db` | DB readiness |
| GET | `/api/v1/health/redis` | Redis readiness |
| GET | `/docs` | OpenAPI UI |
| GET | `/openapi.json` | OpenAPI spec |

