## 7. API Endpoints (new in M10)

| Method | Path | Auth |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/v1/notes` | user |
| GET | `/api/v1/notes` | user (own only) |
| GET | `/api/v1/notes/{id}` | owner |
| PATCH | `/api/v1/notes/{id}` | owner |
| DELETE | `/api/v1/notes/{id}` | owner |
| GET | `/api/v1/notes/{id}/versions` | owner |
| PATCH | `/api/v1/users/me` | user |
| GET | `/api/v1/teacher/courses/{id}/students` | owning teacher |
| GET | `/health/live` | public |
| GET | `/health/ready` | public |

